          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 115173,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Misalnya, kita ingin menemukan elemen tertentu yang memenuhi kondisi yang ditentukan dan mengekstraknya ke dalam array baru.</p><p>Salah satu cara untuk melakukannya adalah melalui loop.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" testScores = [\" /><text value=\"72\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"71\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" arr = [];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" element \" /><text value=\"of\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" testScores) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (element &gt;= \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  arr.push(element);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(arr);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[ 95, 90 ]\" /></content></output></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Calling .filter on an Array",
            "id": 115174,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sebagai gantinya, kita bisa menggunakan fungsi <code>.filter()</code>. <code>.filter()</code> membuat array baru dengan nilai-nilai yang memenuhi suatu kondisi.</p><p><code>.filter()</code> menggunakan sintaks: <code>ArrayName.filter()</code>. Mari panggil metode ini pada array <code>testScores</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" testScores = [\" /><text value=\"72\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"71\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" arr = testScores.filter();\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"76\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".map()\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>testScores</code>, diikuti oleh <code>.</code>, lalu <code>filter</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sebagai gantinya, kita bisa menggunakan fungsi <code>.filter()</code>. <code>.filter()</code> membuat array baru dengan nilai-nilai yang memenuhi suatu kondisi.</p><p>Buat <code>arr</code> dengan memanggil method yang mempertahankan skor cocok, bukan yang mengubah setiap skor.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" testScores = [\" /><text value=\"72\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"71\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" arr = testScores.filter();\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"76\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"map\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"reduce\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"forEach\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>testScores</code>, diikuti oleh <code>.</code>, <code>filter</code>, <code>(</code>, dan terakhir <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Passing Functions",
            "id": 115175,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk memberi tahu fungsi <code>.filter()</code> apakah harus menyertakan atau mengecualikan sebuah nilai dalam array baru, kita perlu meneruskan sebuah fungsi sebagai parameter.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" testScores = [\" /><text value=\"72\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"71\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" arr = testScores.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(arr);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option startIndex=\"84\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"87\" /><option startIndex=\"87\" endIndex=\"88\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>function</code>, diikuti oleh <code>(</code>, lalu <code>)</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk memberi tahu fungsi <code>.filter()</code> apakah harus menyertakan atau mengecualikan sebuah nilai dalam array baru, kita perlu meneruskan sebuah fungsi sebagai parameter.</p><p>Siapkan <code>arr</code> untuk menentukan setiap skor dengan menambahkan callback inline kosong dalam <code>.filter()</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" testScores = [\" /><text value=\"72\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"71\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" arr = testScores.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(arr);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option startIndex=\"84\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"87\" /><option startIndex=\"87\" endIndex=\"88\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[]\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"return\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>function</code>, diikuti oleh <code>(</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>{</code>, dan terakhir <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Parameters",
            "id": 115177,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita perlu memberikan fungsi inline akses ke elemen-elemen array.</p><p>Untuk melakukannya, kita cukup menambahkan parameter ke fungsi. Dalam hal ini, kita akan menggunakan <code>element</code>, tetapi nama apa pun bisa digunakan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" participants = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ben&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sarah&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Eli&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Henry&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sean&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Annabel&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sNames = participants.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"element\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" element[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] === \" /><text value=\"&quot;S&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(sNames);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"118\" endIndex=\"125\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Sarah', 'Sean' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>element</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Return",
            "id": 115176,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk memberi tahu fungsi <code>.filter()</code> nilai mana yang harus disimpan di array baru, pernyataan <code>return</code> dalam fungsi tersebut harus mengembalikan boolean.</p><p>Biasanya kita menulis kondisi yang melibatkan elemen atau indeks array dan menghasilkan nilai boolean.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" testScores = [\" /><text value=\"72\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"71\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" arr = testScores.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"element\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" element &gt;= \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(arr);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"116\" /><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"102\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"arr\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 95, 90 ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>return</code>, diikuti oleh <code>element &gt;= 90</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>.filter()</code> membuat array baru. Fungsi inline menerima tiap value dan mengembalikan <code>true</code> untuk menyimpannya.</p><p>Untuk memberi tahu fungsi <code>.filter()</code> nilai mana yang harus disimpan di array baru, pernyataan <code>return</code> dalam fungsi tersebut harus mengembalikan boolean.</p><p>Simpan hanya skor minimal <code>90</code>, lalu cetak array yang telah difilter.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" testScores = [\" /><text value=\"72\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"71\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" arr = testScores.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"element\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" element &gt;= \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(arr);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"102\" /><option startIndex=\"84\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"111\" endIndex=\"113\" /><option startIndex=\"114\" endIndex=\"116\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"testScores\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 95, 90 ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>element</code>, diikuti oleh <code>return</code>, <code>&gt;=</code>, dan terakhir <code>90</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Parameters II",
            "id": 115178,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jika kita menyertakan parameter kedua dalam fungsi <code>filter()</code>, kita bisa mengakses indeks setiap iterasi bersama nilai array.</p><p>Dalam contoh ini, kita akan menyebut parameternya <code>index</code>, tetapi nama apa pun dapat digunakan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" week = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sunday&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Monday&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tuesday&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Wednesday&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Thursday&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Friday&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Saturday&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" workWeek = week.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"element, index\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (index &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &amp;&amp; index &lt; \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(workWeek);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"140\" endIndex=\"145\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Monday', 'Tuesday', 'Wednesday', 'Thursday', 'Friday' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>index</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Arrow functions",
            "id": 115180,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk menyederhanakan sintaks kita, kita bisa menggunakan fungsi arrow JavaScript sebagai pengganti fungsi inline.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" testScores = [\" /><text value=\"72\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"71\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" arr = testScores.filter(\" /><text value=\"element\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" element &gt;= \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(arr);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"99\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 95, 90 ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>element</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=&gt;</code>, dan terakhir <code>element &gt;= 90</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk menyederhanakan sintaks kita, kita bisa menggunakan fungsi arrow JavaScript sebagai pengganti fungsi inline.</p><p>Gunakan sintaks callback yang lebih pendek untuk mempertahankan skor minimal <code>90</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" testScores = [\" /><text value=\"72\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"71\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" arr = testScores.filter(\" /><text value=\"element\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" element &gt;= \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(arr);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"96\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 95, 90 ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>90</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=&gt;</code>, <code>element</code>, dan terakhir <code>&gt;=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Intro",
            "id": 115276,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fungsi JavaScript mana yang dapat kita gunakan untuk membuat array baru berisi elemen-elemen yang memenuhi suatu kondisi?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>.filter()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>.map()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>.filter()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Method mana yang membuat array baru berisi elemen yang memenuhi kondisi saat kamu hanya menginginkan skor lulus?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>.filter()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>.map()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>.forEach()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>.filter()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Passing Functions",
            "id": 115278,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang harus kita berikan sebagai parameter untuk memberi tahu fungsi <code>.filter()</code> nilai mana yang harus disertakan dalam array baru?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sebuah fungsi</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Hanya pernyataan kondisional</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Sebuah fungsi.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dalam <code>.filter()</code>, apa yang menerima setiap nilai array untuk memutuskan apakah nilai tetap disertakan?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sebuah fungsi</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Hanya pernyataan kondisional</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Array baru</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih Sebuah fungsi.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Parameters",
            "id": 115279,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bagaimana cara meneruskan nilai array ke fungsi inline <code>.filter()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Dengan menambahkan parameter ke fungsi inline</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Dengan menambahkan parameter kedua yang wajib ke fungsi inline</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Dengan menambahkan parameter ke fungsi inline.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kamu menjalankan <code>[80, 95].filter(function(score) { return score &gt;= 90; })</code>.</p><p>Value apa yang diterima <code>score</code> pada pemanggilan pertama fungsi inline?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>80</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Seluruh array <code>[80, 95]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>80</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Parameters II",
            "id": 115280,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang bisa kita akses dengan menyertakan parameter kedua dalam fungsi inline <code>.filter()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Indeks saat ini dalam iterasi</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Array pemanggil</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Indeks saat ini dalam iterasi.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dalam <code>items.filter((item, index) =&gt; ...)</code>, nilai apa yang diwakili <code>index</code> saat callback berjalan?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Indeks saat ini dalam iterasi</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Array pemanggil</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Nilai yang disimpan dalam <code>item</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Indeks saat ini dalam iterasi.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Return",
            "id": 115281,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jenis nilai apa yang dikembalikan fungsi inline dari <code>.filter()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Boolean</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Sebuah string</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih Boolean.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Agar nilai tetap ada dalam array hasil <code>.filter()</code>, apa yang harus dikembalikan callback?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Boolean</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Sebuah string</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Elemen array itu sendiri</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih Boolean.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Arrow functions",
            "id": 115282,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mengapa kita mungkin menggunakan arrow function sebagai pengganti fungsi inline?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Karena arrow function menyederhanakan sintaks</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Karena arrow function tidak memerlukan parameter</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Karena arrow function menyederhanakan sintaks.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mengapa <code>score =&gt; score &gt;= 90</code> dapat menggantikan fungsi inline yang lebih panjang dalam callback filter?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Karena arrow function menyederhanakan sintaks</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Karena arrow function tidak memerlukan parameter</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Karena arrow function selalu mengembalikan array</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Karena arrow function menyederhanakan sintaks.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Calling .filter on an Array",
            "id": 115285,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Panggil fungsi <code>.filter()</code> pada array <code>names</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" names = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Tony&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tania&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Vince&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Terry&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" arr = names.filter(\" /><text value=\"element\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" (element[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] === \" /><text value=\"&quot;T&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"));\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(arr);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"map\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Tony', 'Tania', 'Terry' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>names</code>, diikuti oleh <code>.</code>, dan terakhir <code>filter</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buat array yang hanya berisi nama yang diawali <code>\"T\"</code>, lalu tampilkan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" names = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Tony&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tania&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Vince&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Terry&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" arr = names.filter(\" /><text value=\"element\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" (element[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] === \" /><text value=\"&quot;T&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"));\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(arr);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option startIndex=\"99\" endIndex=\"102\" /><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"106\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"map\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Vince\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Tony', 'Tania', 'Terry' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>names</code>, diikuti oleh <code>filter</code>, <code>element</code>, <code>===</code>, dan terakhir <code>\"T\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Passing Functions",
            "id": 115286,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tambahkan fungsi inline di dalam fungsi <code>.filter()</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" customerTotals = [\" /><text value=\"99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"56\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"78\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"110\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"58\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" largeOrder = customerTotals.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"99\" /><option startIndex=\"99\" endIndex=\"100\" /><option startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"101\" /><option startIndex=\"102\" endIndex=\"103\" /><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"104\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>function</code>, diikuti oleh <code>(</code>, lalu <code>)</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Parameters",
            "id": 115287,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tambahkan parameter yang sesuai agar fungsi inline dapat mengakses nilai-nilai array.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prices = [\" /><text value=\"19.99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20.99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"18.99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17.99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"21.99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" inBudget = prices.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"price\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price &lt; \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(inBudget);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"97\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 19.99, 18.99, 17.99 ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>price</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Return",
            "id": 115289,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kodekan keyword yang benar agar fungsi <code>.filter()</code> mengisi array <code>shortSleeveDay</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" weather = [\" /><text value=\"67\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"78\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"73\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"77\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"82\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"93\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" shortSleeveDay = weather.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"temp\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" temp &gt; \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(shortSleeveDay);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"104\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 78, 77, 82, 93 ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>return</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Parameters II",
            "id": 115288,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Susun parameter dalam urutan yang benar agar <code>top3</code> menyimpan tiga <code>finishers</code> pertama.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" finishers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sarah&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sally&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jake&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tori&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" top3 = finishers.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"finisher, place\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" place &lt; \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(top3);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"109\" /><option startIndex=\"109\" endIndex=\"110\" /><option startIndex=\"111\" endIndex=\"116\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Sarah', 'Sally', 'Jake' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>finisher</code>, diikuti oleh <code>,</code>, dan terakhir <code>place</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Parameter inline kedua menerima tiap indeks, mulai dari <code>0</code>. Beri nama parameter pertama <code>finisher</code>.</p><p>Simpan tiga finisher pertama dengan menguji posisi tiap finisher, lalu cetak <code>top3</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" finishers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sarah&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sally&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jake&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tori&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" top3 = finishers.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"finisher, place\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" place &lt; \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(top3);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"109\" /><option startIndex=\"128\" endIndex=\"133\" /><option startIndex=\"134\" endIndex=\"135\" /><option startIndex=\"136\" endIndex=\"137\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"index\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"finishers\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Sarah', 'Sally', 'Jake' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>finisher</code>, diikuti oleh <code>place</code>, <code>&lt;</code>, dan terakhir <code>3</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Arrow functions",
            "id": 115290,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buat kode fungsi arrow yang mengembalikan <code>true</code> jika indeks elemen kurang dari 3.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" finishers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sarah&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sally&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jake&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tori&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" top3 = \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" finishers.filter(\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"finisher, place\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" place &lt; \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(top3);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"112\" endIndex=\"114\" /><option startIndex=\"115\" endIndex=\"120\" /><option startIndex=\"121\" endIndex=\"122\" /><option startIndex=\"123\" endIndex=\"124\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"111\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Sarah', 'Sally', 'Jake' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>(finisher, place)</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=&gt;</code>, lalu <code>place</code>, <code>&lt;</code>, <code>3</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Letakkan beberapa parameter fungsi arrow dalam tanda kurung, seperti <code>(finisher, place)</code>.</p><p>Gunakan fungsi arrow untuk menyimpan tiga finisher pertama dan cetak <code>top3</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" finishers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sarah&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sally&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jake&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tori&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" top3 = \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" finishers.filter(\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"finisher, place\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" place &lt; \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(top3);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"111\" /><option startIndex=\"112\" endIndex=\"114\" /><option startIndex=\"115\" endIndex=\"120\" /><option startIndex=\"121\" endIndex=\"122\" /><option startIndex=\"123\" endIndex=\"124\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"index\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Sarah', 'Sally', 'Jake' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>(finisher, place)</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=&gt;</code>, <code>place</code>, <code>&lt;</code>, dan terakhir <code>3</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
